+ * 2026-11-27, per explicit request: with a [profile], IOB counts as IOB x ISF and COB as COB x ISF / IC, so a bolus that
+ * matches its carbs cancels out (26 Nov Tandem: right after a 6.70 U bolus, 1 mmol per U against 1 mmol per 12 g read HP1
